WEBVTT

00:01:27.060 --> 00:01:27.920
How's Valkyrie?

00:01:28.320 --> 00:01:30.280
It locked down Ion II.

00:01:30.630 --> 00:01:31.450
Locked down?

00:01:32.160 --> 00:01:35.960
We've been unable to contact the remaining staff inside Ion II.

00:01:36.590 --> 00:01:37.820
What about the criminals on Hecate?

00:01:38.170 --> 00:01:39.450
They've all been evacuated.

00:01:40.170 --> 00:01:43.590
Why would Valkyrie lock down Ion II?

00:01:44.170 --> 00:01:47.550
About the security system, I wasn't told anything about it.

00:01:48.880 --> 00:01:50.680
<i>For some reason this gives me the creeps...</i>

00:01:51.730 --> 00:01:53.600
<i>What is Valkyrie planning?</i>

00:02:08.910 --> 00:02:10.250
Intruder confirmed.

00:02:10.790 --> 00:02:12.360
Security System activated.

00:02:17.500 --> 00:02:19.080
These are all individual cells?

00:02:19.590 --> 00:02:21.600
Most of them are empty though.

00:02:22.200 --> 00:02:25.310
The number of criminals lessens as the population decreases.

00:02:26.640 --> 00:02:30.940
Those with the strength to commit serious
offences are all sent to Chimera.

00:02:32.540 --> 00:02:34.100
The population decreased this much...

00:02:40.360 --> 00:02:41.580
This is the entrance to Ion II.

00:02:42.230 --> 00:02:44.280
Professor Loki, please unlock it.

00:02:48.390 --> 00:02:49.730
Go straight through the communications room.

00:02:50.100 --> 00:02:52.220
That's the most direct route to the computer control
room, which is the furthest room from here.

00:02:52.790 --> 00:02:53.400
I'm opening it.

00:03:00.130 --> 00:03:00.820
What is it?!

00:03:03.510 --> 00:03:04.410
The guards...

00:03:05.250 --> 00:03:06.460
Everyone's been killed.

00:03:06.980 --> 00:03:07.870
How cruel.

00:03:09.740 --> 00:03:11.750
This method of killing isn't human...

00:03:18.920 --> 00:03:19.430
Damn!

00:03:19.430 --> 00:03:20.070
Wait!

00:03:20.680 --> 00:03:21.320
That's...!

00:03:29.280 --> 00:03:30.070
Impossible...

00:03:30.330 --> 00:03:34.040
The plants from Chimera were preserved in their seed state.

00:03:34.360 --> 00:03:36.670
Valkyrie stimulated their growth.

00:03:37.090 --> 00:03:38.020
What for?

00:03:38.410 --> 00:03:40.120
So that they could be used as biological weapons.

00:03:44.880 --> 00:03:45.490
Damn!!!

00:03:45.490 --> 00:03:46.150
Stop!

00:03:51.690 --> 00:03:52.940
Burn it, quickly!

00:03:53.100 --> 00:03:53.920
Give me that!

00:03:59.840 --> 00:04:01.480
Don't shoot as if they're normal trees;

00:04:01.840 --> 00:04:03.020
these are Calypso.

00:04:04.860 --> 00:04:07.570
That guy really is a Jyu Oh, isn't he.

00:04:16.580 --> 00:04:17.330
Don't move!

00:04:18.180 --> 00:04:19.040
Verasona!

00:04:19.520 --> 00:04:20.230
What should we do?

00:04:20.800 --> 00:04:22.610
They've made their nest under here.

00:04:23.370 --> 00:04:26.280
Verasonas can't be killed unless we destroy their bulbs.

00:04:27.490 --> 00:04:28.260
I'll do it.

00:04:29.500 --> 00:04:30.230
Get down!

00:04:42.100 --> 00:04:43.430
Third, cover me!

00:04:43.690 --> 00:04:44.470
It's Heiza!

00:05:03.640 --> 00:05:05.920
This is the reality of Chimera...

00:05:06.800 --> 00:05:08.240
It should be safe from now on.

00:05:08.850 --> 00:05:12.380
No other carnivorous plants can coexist with Verasona.

00:05:12.530 --> 00:05:13.280
Let's go!

00:05:14.320 --> 00:05:15.010
Not yet.

00:05:15.980 --> 00:05:18.100
Plants aren't the only biological weapon.

00:05:19.120 --> 00:05:19.930
There are others.

00:05:21.860 --> 00:05:22.480
Jyu Oh!

00:05:28.250 --> 00:05:29.770
Don't bring any belongings!

00:05:30.120 --> 00:05:31.220
Throw away your weapons!

00:05:31.680 --> 00:05:33.560
Hurry! We don't have time!

00:05:34.240 --> 00:05:34.880
Tiz,

00:05:35.930 --> 00:05:38.830
you should board as well. Thor is there, isn't he?

00:05:39.100 --> 00:05:40.090
Later, okay.

00:05:40.490 --> 00:05:42.300
Thor can definitely handle it himself!

00:05:43.150 --> 00:05:44.020
And anyway...

00:05:45.560 --> 00:05:49.090
Thor finally said it - <i>"Let's have a child."</i>

00:05:53.790 --> 00:05:54.830
Stay calm!

00:05:56.650 --> 00:05:57.400
Captain!

00:06:00.890 --> 00:06:02.510
Damn!!!

00:06:09.200 --> 00:06:09.880
Hold your fire!

00:06:10.240 --> 00:06:11.510
You'll injure our people!

00:06:18.850 --> 00:06:21.300
Thor, take the professor and go on ahead.

00:06:25.820 --> 00:06:28.010
Those motionless eyes, just like glass marbles...

00:06:29.150 --> 00:06:32.610
Those guys are simply reacting... they're not puppets.

00:06:44.600 --> 00:06:45.350
Jyu Oh...

00:06:49.280 --> 00:06:50.980
They're reviving one after another.

00:06:51.340 --> 00:06:52.360
It's not going to end.

00:07:03.400 --> 00:07:04.130
Stop!

00:07:04.290 --> 00:07:05.500
They're important samples!

00:07:05.840 --> 00:07:06.860
They're still alive!

00:07:11.260 --> 00:07:12.740
You call this <i>"alive"?</i>

00:07:13.850 --> 00:07:15.460
They already long dead!

00:07:16.270 --> 00:07:17.790
These are Jyu Ohs?!

00:07:19.250 --> 00:07:22.310
These people... they're still human beings!

00:07:23.420 --> 00:07:25.460
Keeping humans as garbage here like this...

00:07:26.080 --> 00:07:28.000
What exactly are you saving?!

00:07:29.380 --> 00:07:30.140
And...

00:07:31.150 --> 00:07:33.850
I was made from these Jyu Oh's you gathered...

00:07:34.400 --> 00:07:35.630
the worst...

00:07:37.390 --> 00:07:38.190
Kill them.

00:07:39.240 --> 00:07:40.390
Kill them all!

00:07:40.960 --> 00:07:43.200
Kill them as humans, at the very least!

00:07:49.500 --> 00:07:50.260
What's this?

00:07:54.890 --> 00:07:56.040
A three-dimensional projection...

00:07:57.990 --> 00:08:00.250
Don't be rash, Thor.

00:08:00.950 --> 00:08:01.760
This voice...

00:08:02.640 --> 00:08:03.260
Thor.

00:08:04.000 --> 00:08:04.670
Mother!

00:08:05.090 --> 00:08:05.730
Eva?

00:08:06.420 --> 00:08:08.710
Don't listen! It's a synthesized voice!

00:08:10.060 --> 00:08:10.800
Thor,

00:08:11.670 --> 00:08:16.150
the Self-rotation Acceleration System has to be activated.

00:08:16.950 --> 00:08:18.570
We can no longer return to Earth...

00:08:19.930 --> 00:08:21.110
because the Earth...

00:08:21.140 --> 00:08:22.460
Valkyrie!

00:08:22.500 --> 00:08:24.070
...13O years ago,

00:08:24.230 --> 00:08:25.810
was blown to pieces.

00:08:36.690 --> 00:08:38.630
What could have caused this?

00:08:39.760 --> 00:08:41.050
500,000 years ago,

00:08:41.360 --> 00:08:43.590
a huge meteorite passed Chimera,

00:08:45.100 --> 00:08:48.680
causing Chimera's current self-rotating speed.

00:08:49.490 --> 00:08:52.460
Passing through the eras, it gave the Earth a direct hit.

00:08:53.940 --> 00:08:54.700
It's a lie!

00:08:56.200 --> 00:08:57.610
That's impossible...

00:08:58.650 --> 00:09:00.650
Juno could not reveal the truth...

00:09:01.700 --> 00:09:03.950
that Earth no longer exists.

00:09:07.010 --> 00:09:08.290
Then, I...

00:09:08.860 --> 00:09:16.170
why did I change my name, change the colour
of my skin... even erase my own past?

00:09:17.420 --> 00:09:20.170
The teams visiting Earth have all
had their memories manipulated.

00:09:20.770 --> 00:09:23.010
A simulation of having been to Earth...

00:09:29.710 --> 00:09:31.250
Stand up, Heiza!

00:09:32.230 --> 00:09:34.270
Do you think you're the only one who's had their life taken away?

00:09:35.420 --> 00:09:36.740
Mine was taken away too.

00:09:37.680 --> 00:09:39.590
Even my very existence has been denied.

00:09:41.400 --> 00:09:42.700
Stop being a spoilt brat!

00:09:43.140 --> 00:09:46.970
You chose it yourself; this way of living!

00:09:47.360 --> 00:09:49.490
You have neither the right, nor time to cry now.

00:09:50.020 --> 00:09:53.450
Follow it through to the end, this life you chose for yourself!

00:10:02.340 --> 00:10:05.010
This is the computer control room.

00:10:06.880 --> 00:10:08.120
Is this Valkyrie, huh?

00:10:08.580 --> 00:10:09.290
It is.

00:10:09.850 --> 00:10:11.130
Any security systems here?

00:10:11.490 --> 00:10:12.420
It's alright,

00:10:12.520 --> 00:10:13.640
there aren't any in here.

00:10:15.340 --> 00:10:17.380
From here we can stop the Ball.

00:10:24.660 --> 00:10:25.420
It's no good!

00:10:26.240 --> 00:10:28.280
Valkyrie is refusing access!

00:10:33.560 --> 00:10:34.910
Destroy Valkyrie.

00:10:35.010 --> 00:10:35.990
What did you say?!

00:10:36.070 --> 00:10:36.920
That's all we can do.

00:10:40.060 --> 00:10:43.270
Valkyrie is connected directly with the canon's power reactor!

00:10:43.520 --> 00:10:46.470
If we destroy it, it'll lose control and cause a huge explosion!

00:10:46.800 --> 00:10:48.740
This is the only way to save Chimera.

00:10:48.780 --> 00:10:50.420
The emergency shield will be activated!

00:10:50.510 --> 00:10:52.020
We won't make it out of here!

00:10:52.250 --> 00:10:54.720
We can use the heliport on the roof.

00:10:54.770 --> 00:10:56.640
But the elevator!

00:10:56.890 --> 00:10:58.560
Climb the maintenance ladder.

00:10:59.210 --> 00:11:00.730
Lock on - Valkyrie!

00:11:01.400 --> 00:11:02.330
Don't...

00:11:02.520 --> 00:11:03.110
Fire!

00:11:23.290 --> 00:11:24.420
What have you done...

00:11:25.070 --> 00:11:26.380
It's a race against time now.

00:11:27.010 --> 00:11:28.120
We have 20 minutes to get to the roof.

00:11:28.170 --> 00:11:30.270
No matter how fast you are, it'll take at least 40 minutes!

00:11:30.360 --> 00:11:32.720
In that case, Thor should be able to make it out alive.

00:11:34.630 --> 00:11:35.930
That's enough, isn't it?

00:11:39.090 --> 00:11:40.600
An emergency transmission from Hecate:

00:11:40.920 --> 00:11:42.700
The canon power reactor can no longer be controlled.

00:11:43.120 --> 00:11:46.110
I'm afraid they've destroyed Valkyrie.

00:11:47.220 --> 00:11:49.610
The Ball has diverted from its route.
It's started to manoeuvre irratically.

00:11:49.870 --> 00:11:50.940
It can't be controlled.

00:11:51.440 --> 00:11:52.790
What's going on?

00:11:53.200 --> 00:11:53.820
This is...

00:11:56.750 --> 00:11:58.070
What is that?

00:11:58.160 --> 00:11:59.080
It's Musa!

00:11:59.440 --> 00:12:00.950
Their roots are growing rapidly!

00:12:01.180 --> 00:12:04.090
How can Musa grow outside of their germination period?!

00:12:04.180 --> 00:12:05.000
But...

00:12:05.590 --> 00:12:07.380
it seems they have a will of their own...

00:12:20.290 --> 00:12:21.070
Zagi!

00:12:21.660 --> 00:12:22.480
What are you doing?

00:12:23.480 --> 00:12:25.690
I wanted a ship of my own.

00:12:26.350 --> 00:12:30.820
As long as I could enjoy myself,
I wouldn't even care if that ship sank.

00:12:31.400 --> 00:12:32.900
But then I realized,

00:12:33.120 --> 00:12:35.780
the wheel was already in the hands of another captain.

00:12:37.160 --> 00:12:38.120
What a laugh.

00:12:38.230 --> 00:12:40.000
Enough. You should hurry too!

00:12:40.280 --> 00:12:41.700
You're the one who should hurry and go.

00:12:41.950 --> 00:12:44.380
It's my responsibility to take care of everything till the end.

00:12:44.650 --> 00:12:47.610
And anyway, I need to ensure the safety of Top's friend.

00:12:48.070 --> 00:12:49.060
Friend?

00:12:49.780 --> 00:12:51.840
Thor didn't deal you the final blow,

00:12:52.050 --> 00:12:53.260
therefore you're his friend!

00:12:55.070 --> 00:12:56.620
The only difference between he and I

00:12:57.240 --> 00:13:00.530
might just be being loved by an idiot like you.

00:13:02.590 --> 00:13:03.250
Chen!

00:13:03.730 --> 00:13:04.400
Zagi!

00:13:05.030 --> 00:13:06.820
Night Ring's enemy!

00:13:12.590 --> 00:13:13.200
Tiz!

00:13:15.350 --> 00:13:15.950
Tiz...

00:13:17.780 --> 00:13:18.460
Damn!

00:13:23.870 --> 00:13:24.500
Tiz!

00:13:24.930 --> 00:13:26.290
Tiz!!!

00:13:31.230 --> 00:13:33.300
Thor, we've already lost 30 seconds!

00:13:33.540 --> 00:13:34.150
Hurry.

00:13:37.070 --> 00:13:37.840
Verasona!

00:13:38.670 --> 00:13:40.230
There are still more alive?!

00:13:40.650 --> 00:13:41.580
Climb, Thor!

00:13:42.970 --> 00:13:44.660
No! We won't make it in time!

00:13:47.090 --> 00:13:47.870
Professor!

00:13:51.500 --> 00:13:53.940
Go! I'll lock down this block!

00:13:55.160 --> 00:13:56.180
Thor, keep climbing!

00:13:56.540 --> 00:13:57.280
Don't look back!

00:14:07.120 --> 00:14:09.450
Go, Last Child...

00:14:10.120 --> 00:14:11.600
Eva's son.

00:14:16.280 --> 00:14:18.320
Ball A has arrived at the core.

00:14:19.080 --> 00:14:21.060
Is it finally over?

00:14:22.280 --> 00:14:25.020
Your Excellency, the Ball... The Ball has stopped!

00:14:26.170 --> 00:14:28.560
Balls A, C, D, and E have stopped.

00:14:29.020 --> 00:14:30.330
What about B and F?

00:14:31.080 --> 00:14:33.070
It's Musa!... Musa's roots!

00:14:33.480 --> 00:14:35.150
The Plants...

00:14:39.110 --> 00:14:40.120
Dagger Pagoda...

00:14:41.360 --> 00:14:42.530
Chen, run!

00:14:46.010 --> 00:14:48.250
Tiz? Pull yourself together, Tiz!

00:14:48.880 --> 00:14:49.500
Tiz!

00:14:56.310 --> 00:14:57.130
Zagi...

00:14:57.250 --> 00:15:00.160
Idiot... Why did you protect me?

00:15:01.630 --> 00:15:04.490
Pull yourself together. If you don't go back...

00:15:04.930 --> 00:15:05.820
that guy...

00:15:09.110 --> 00:15:12.730
Thor is strong, but he's a cry-baby.

00:15:13.800 --> 00:15:15.120
I have to be with him...

00:15:16.950 --> 00:15:18.140
so I'll go back...

00:15:19.340 --> 00:15:23.470
For Thor... I'll go back.

00:15:32.200 --> 00:15:33.180
He...

00:15:34.110 --> 00:15:35.000
...will cry.

00:15:46.360 --> 00:15:49.140
Musa stopped this thing?

00:15:51.910 --> 00:15:53.000
Look, Tiz.

00:15:53.980 --> 00:15:55.940
This is Chimera's will.

00:15:59.930 --> 00:16:00.900
I can't open it.

00:16:01.590 --> 00:16:03.080
There must be a switch somewhere.

00:16:04.860 --> 00:16:05.520
Here.

00:16:14.950 --> 00:16:17.860
Heiza, use my body to climb up!

00:16:17.920 --> 00:16:19.890
Let go. You'll fall as well.

00:16:20.020 --> 00:16:21.280
I won't give up!

00:16:21.370 --> 00:16:24.430
Let go! Don't make my entire life worth nothing!

00:16:28.560 --> 00:16:30.370
No... Heiza!

00:16:32.510 --> 00:16:34.990
Even if I'm telling you to, you won't let go, huh?

00:16:37.130 --> 00:16:38.280
Isn't that right, Thor?

00:16:39.110 --> 00:16:41.370
That's because you're the Jyu Oh I made.

00:16:41.880 --> 00:16:42.680
Third...

00:16:45.660 --> 00:16:49.010
I did everything in order to make you a Jyu Oh.

00:16:49.790 --> 00:16:51.490
Killing Karin too.

00:16:52.550 --> 00:16:54.910
That was such a success, wasn't it.

00:16:56.360 --> 00:16:59.880
For the sake of a planet that didn't exist,
creating the person called <i>"Third"...</i>

00:17:00.820 --> 00:17:03.760
the sorrowful story of a soldier in hell.

00:17:04.610 --> 00:17:08.740
This farce... it's about time it was finished.

00:17:09.910 --> 00:17:10.870
Third, don't!

00:17:12.100 --> 00:17:14.090
Go back, to Chimera.

00:17:14.910 --> 00:17:17.090
Tiz is waiting, Top.

00:17:18.320 --> 00:17:19.230
Third!

00:17:19.740 --> 00:17:21.390
Third!!!

00:17:26.640 --> 00:17:27.660
Third...

00:17:42.550 --> 00:17:43.470
Third...

00:17:50.470 --> 00:17:51.710
The colour of my skin...

00:17:54.640 --> 00:17:57.520
Conscious of it's next appearance at a time like this?

00:17:58.730 --> 00:18:01.360
The DNA which struggles to survive, no matter what, huh?

00:18:02.660 --> 00:18:03.280
But...

00:18:04.280 --> 00:18:04.970
No!

00:18:11.150 --> 00:18:11.790
Tiz?

00:18:13.460 --> 00:18:15.330
Don't go to a place like that.

00:18:17.070 --> 00:18:18.110
This way!

00:18:19.720 --> 00:18:20.360
Tiz...

00:18:26.470 --> 00:18:27.580
Yes, Thor.

00:18:30.400 --> 00:18:31.110
Come back.

00:18:34.140 --> 00:18:34.820
Tiz...

00:18:38.480 --> 00:18:39.250
There he is!

00:18:39.540 --> 00:18:40.360
Grab hold!

00:18:41.480 --> 00:18:42.280
Hurry!

00:18:42.590 --> 00:18:44.730
Please wait! My friend is still-

00:18:46.220 --> 00:18:47.070
No way...

00:18:47.560 --> 00:18:48.620
Just now, she was...

00:18:50.260 --> 00:18:51.200
What are you doing?!

00:18:51.230 --> 00:18:52.280
Let me off!

00:18:52.560 --> 00:18:54.110
He's safe. Hurry!

00:18:54.230 --> 00:18:55.260
Hurry up and get out of here!

00:18:56.920 --> 00:18:58.750
Let me get off. Let go of me!

00:18:59.500 --> 00:19:00.060
Tiz...

00:19:01.000 --> 00:19:02.310
Tiz!!!

00:19:16.090 --> 00:19:18.520
I heard you'd survived...

00:19:18.950 --> 00:19:21.860
I know humanity will continue to survive.

00:19:23.010 --> 00:19:25.690
I won't interfere with that planet again.

00:19:26.860 --> 00:19:30.820
Chimera doesn't need the old human race.

00:19:32.640 --> 00:19:34.830
I always wanted to leave that planet...

00:19:36.380 --> 00:19:38.580
but now that planet has become my hope.

00:19:39.810 --> 00:19:41.460
I have much to tell you.

00:19:42.660 --> 00:19:44.250
I don't hate you anymore.

00:20:08.410 --> 00:20:09.950
You killed it, Chen?

00:20:10.250 --> 00:20:10.780
Yes.

00:20:11.990 --> 00:20:12.580
Come here.

00:20:13.420 --> 00:20:14.920
Taking in another child?

00:20:15.460 --> 00:20:17.170
We don't have enough food as it is.

00:20:17.650 --> 00:20:19.060
After the collapse of the Rings,

00:20:19.440 --> 00:20:21.090
people aren't coming from above anymore.

00:20:21.290 --> 00:20:23.250
I'm glad of that.

00:20:24.380 --> 00:20:27.670
There won't be any more pointless fights in order to go up,

00:20:28.310 --> 00:20:30.470
and no more rules for us to obey.

00:20:31.010 --> 00:20:31.850
What's going on?

00:20:34.150 --> 00:20:34.890
Thor.

00:20:38.030 --> 00:20:38.810
Your name?

00:20:41.700 --> 00:20:43.120
You don't have one, do you.

00:20:44.080 --> 00:20:44.760
It's Tiz.

00:20:45.890 --> 00:20:46.690
Tiz?

00:20:49.740 --> 00:20:50.920
It's a good name.

00:20:51.340 --> 00:20:52.930
It means Hope.

00:20:56.060 --> 00:20:56.820
Tiz.

00:20:57.760 --> 00:20:58.610
That's right.
